  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GSlarWa.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mbSQxHhbBt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ENSE1Om.png\" width=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYoCsJCHn1jOnGvKLBs0bqg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LTDGG4f.png\" width=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ProjectCount\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MSv7RBC.png\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📖關於</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Aqua Delight</strong> 透過多種水生主題料理擴展了 Minecraft 的烹飪世界，為玩家提供了利用水生資源製作美味餐點的新方法。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📃功能特色</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>水生主題料理</strong>：使用水生資源（包含海龜肉與蜂蜜河豚）烹調餐點。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>升級的烹飪選項</strong>：新增獨特食譜以豐富遊戲玩法，並提供多樣化的美味選擇。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📚未來計畫</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">未來的更新將包含：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增更多以水生生物與植物為主題的食譜。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">與《<em>Farmer's Delight</em>》等熱門模組進行整合。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特定料理具備獨特的特殊效果。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📝描述</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Aqua Delight</strong> 為 Minecraft 帶來了全新的風味，推出了多款水生主題料理。從飽實的海龜肉佳餚到精緻的蜂蜜河豚美食，本模組為水生資源賦予了創新的用途，大幅豐富了玩家的烹飪可能性。潛入海洋收集食材，烹調一桌盛宴來提升你的冒險體驗吧。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vbEQJBM.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">未來的更新預計將進一步擴充料理種類，並與其他模組整合，為您帶來更沉浸的烹飪體驗。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🎨 我們的模組</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vegetables-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sTYFDIt.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-changes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0EvRMeF.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/piglin-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/msiJ1Qo.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-randomite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5W1ePQ5.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/genetics-vegetables\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MrznpWc.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/schizophrenia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N3mWm8R.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VI5tY37.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-creative-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aPIDl78.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bamboo-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KfWDC6t.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hardness-diamond-ore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/40qWlek.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sweet-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ycApO0w.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/usa-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6KmYwH9.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/italy-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.